      "id": "claim_fd5fbe978ee0453d85b354dcce340883",
      "statement": "langchain-quickjs is not a remote shell backend but a deepagents middleware (CodeInterpreterMiddleware) that gives an agent a persistent sandboxed JavaScript REPL tool backed by an embedded QuickJS engine, where state persists across eval calls and each LangGraph thread_id gets its own QuickJS Runtime so separate conversations cannot see each other's globals.",
